{"name": "Bakery Cafe Simulator", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play solo or up to 4 players online. Open your own Bakery caf\u00e9 and grow your business by serving your customers the delicious dishes you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"240\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1784627682\" width=\"426\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1784627682\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Bake, build, and grow your dream bakery cafe! Create delicious pastries, design your space, and serve customers. Play solo or with friends in online co-op to expand your business and experience the excitement of running a bustling cafe!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3444080/39897fe22ba204a2dfeb7855c7ad4eef7f61e514/header.jpg?t=1784627682", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Simulation", "Cooking", "First-Person", "Online Co-Op", "Early Access", "Sandbox"], "developers": "Meerkatt Studio", "publishers": "Meerkatt Studio", "release_date": "Jul 8, 2025", "price": "$11.99", "appid": "3444080", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "5 April 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/NIUtR9q7p1w", "first_seen": 1743804000.0, "review_rank": 1737}